            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "plates4u"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved this recipe. Unfortunately, I did not have rice vinegar so I used white vinegar and it came out very good. The sweetness of the ripe heirloom tomatoes was so nicely mixed with the rosemary. It was so fast and so good. Will make it again!",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-21T21:00:15.137Z"
          },
          {
