            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Candi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A quick, tastey and healthy side dish! I was looking for something to do with all my Juliet tomatoes (grape-like, but the taste is like a regular size tomato). I split 12 oz. of these in half and tossed with the dressing in amounts listed and it was just a bit too much dressing... but I could add these to a lettuce salad and wouldn't need additional dressing! Thanks!",
