              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amanda SusieQ"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I only wish heirloom tomatoes weren't so expensive, because I want this all the time! I used avocado oil instead of olive oil just because, and ended up drinking the leftover liquid in my bowl AND my husband's! I also put a few toasted pine nuts on for a garnish, though I can't say they enhanced or detracted from the flavor. \n\nI highly recommend!",
